{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a living, AI-driven universe spanning 150+ planets and 600+ intelligent NPCs. Rise from a rookie trader to a galactic tycoon: manage storefronts, forge a Commerce Guild, and become the nexus between Factions, steering the fate of the Galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a truly fluid economy where supply, demand, and prices are never static\u2014they are organically sculpted by the stances, relationships, and decisions of AI NPCs. In this uncharted void, commerce is more than profit\u2014it is the power to reshape the very rules of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/e0a5b457c9cf4583bd056f1e69e02575.webp?t=1772616610\" width=1170 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/36c4344868699801ecb4a36f89e1648c.poster.avif?t=1772616610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/36c4344868699801ecb4a36f89e1648c.webm?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/36c4344868699801ecb4a36f89e1648c.mp4?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Infinite Sandbox, Unbound Destinies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shatter the chains of linear gameplay and live out divergent paths. Start as a Rookie Trader, profiting from the classic &quot;buy low, sell high.&quot; Rise to a Guild Manager, forging Trade Routes and commanding staff. Ascend to a Magnate, allying with Military Factions. Or roam as a Freelancer, carving your own legend across the stars in a dynamic, AI-driven world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/ce505f2bc0bfcc1d47418638c2ad9c4c.poster.avif?t=1772616610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/ce505f2bc0bfcc1d47418638c2ad9c4c.webm?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/ce505f2bc0bfcc1d47418638c2ad9c4c.mp4?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022\u00a0A Living World Driven by AI</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices leave real scars on the universe. Over 600 AI-driven NPCs operate with distinct identities, long-term goals, and behavioral logic. They react dynamically to your actions, market shifts, and Faction relations. Their decisions don't just add flavor\u2014they actively reshape the trading climate, power structures, and the very fate of the Galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/bc07d95e21fdd050420084d1e65a1668.poster.avif?t=1772616610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/bc07d95e21fdd050420084d1e65a1668.webm?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/bc07d95e21fdd050420084d1e65a1668.mp4?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022\u00a0A Volatile, Real-Time Economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget static spreadsheets. Prices here are driven by real-time AI behavior. From a single price shift caused by trend-chasing investments, to planetary economic ripples triggered by new Trade Routes, or sudden market crashes ignited by war and catastrophe. The economy is a living ecosystem, organically sculpted by NPC actions and world events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/a58640e91a5ee173e486041268c54870.poster.avif?t=1772616610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/a58640e91a5ee173e486041268c54870.webm?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/a58640e91a5ee173e486041268c54870.mp4?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022\u00a0Simulation \u00d7 Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique fusion of genres: the strategic depth of resource accumulation meets the high stakes of permadeath. Build Outposts from scratch, allocating population, upgrading facilities, and unlocking tech trees under the pressure of limited time and resources. With random events, periodic Magnetic Storms, and unknown crises looming, you must constantly adapt your strategy to survive and expand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/6b5d7ffa993b696325e683a25b72e1a4.poster.avif?t=1772616610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/6b5d7ffa993b696325e683a25b72e1a4.webm?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/6b5d7ffa993b696325e683a25b72e1a4.mp4?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022\u00a0Explore the Unknown, Rebuild Civilization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart the void and reshape the stellar map. Navigate the vast expanse to uncover Ancient Ruins, trigger random encounters, and salvage lost technology. Evolve from a fleeting traveler into a ruler of the cosmos. This is your story to write.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/835bd5cae88a0fcd46cef7bd1b260d23.avif?t=1772616610\" width=800 height=477 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3105960?t=1772616610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772616610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/91939c10c59da0098a78c583fd260444e835ea80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772616610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/91939c10c59da0098a78c583fd260444e835ea80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772616610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4054630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a living, AI-driven universe spanning 150+ planets and 600+ intelligent NPCs. Rise from a rookie trader to a galactic tycoon: manage storefronts, forge a Commerce Guild, and become the nexus between Factions, steering the fate of the Galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a truly fluid economy where supply, demand, and prices are never static\u2014they are organically sculpted by the stances, relationships, and decisions of AI NPCs. In this uncharted void, commerce is more than profit\u2014it is the power to reshape the very rules of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/e0a5b457c9cf4583bd056f1e69e02575.webp?t=1772616610\" width=1170 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/36c4344868699801ecb4a36f89e1648c.poster.avif?t=1772616610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/36c4344868699801ecb4a36f89e1648c.webm?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/36c4344868699801ecb4a36f89e1648c.mp4?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Infinite Sandbox, Unbound Destinies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shatter the chains of linear gameplay and live out divergent paths. Start as a Rookie Trader, profiting from the classic &quot;buy low, sell high.&quot; Rise to a Guild Manager, forging Trade Routes and commanding staff. Ascend to a Magnate, allying with Military Factions. Or roam as a Freelancer, carving your own legend across the stars in a dynamic, AI-driven world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"