r. From a single price shift caused by trend-chasing investments, to planetary economic ripples triggered by new Trade Routes, or sudden market crashes ignited by war and catastrophe. The economy is a living ecosystem, organically sculpted by NPC actions and world events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/a58640e91a5ee173e486041268c54870.poster.avif?t=1772616610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/a58640e91a5ee173e486041268c54870.webm?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/a58640e91a5ee173e486041268c54870.mp4?t=1772616610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022\u00a0Simulation \u00d7 Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique fusion of genres: the strategic depth of resource accumulation meets the high stakes of permadeath. Build Outposts from scratch, allocating population, upgrading facilities, and unlocking tech trees under the pressure of limited time and resources. With random events, periodic Magnetic Storms, and unknown crises looming, you must constantly adapt your strategy to survive and expand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/6b5d7ffa993b696325e683a25b72e1a4.poster.avif?t=1772616610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras